229e2610d"},"text":"[color=#4f81bd]说起来，昨晚我也做了个很离奇的梦。\n我和另一个肥肥出门谈业务回来，魂宝（对，就是茗魂，虽然没见过面，但梦里就是默认是她，不知为什么，很怪。总之设定就是这样）对肥肥说，你们又说错话了，居然说直岗山是杭州的。我很气，说我没说啊，直岗山不是安徽的吗！魂宝于是对肥肥说，说对了。你看！（意思是我是对的，他说错了）\n醒来后，我总觉得有哪里不对，一查，\nTMD根本没有直岗山这座山！[emot=acfun,1820/][/color]","time":1696400536513,"floor":27,"likes":5,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":4,"hot":true,"replyPreview":[{"id":"793653107","root":"793652944","user":{"id":"673694","name":"千羽文言","avatar":"86dfc0cb13e279d0b4c99120"},"text":"直岗直肛，这是在警示你做个直男经常提肛","time":1696400985324,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"793653185","root":"793652944","user":{"id":"123824","name":"蓝字","avatar":"98c51f1fc4d31ab229e2610d"},"text":"[color=#4f81bd]在提了，在提了[emot=acfun,1716/][/color]","time":1696401243483,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"千羽文言","replyToUserId":"673694","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"793657714","root":"793652944","user":{"id":"310655","name":"酸辣豆腐羹","avatar":"cb18430608939a581d765cc3"},"text":"你怎么知道地府没有这个地方？[emot=acfun,1656/]","time":1696416922152,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]}],"media":{"00af64e9f114128aa20987c3":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/55513717_4c4a1f7fe455440b8d5a14bd81f1c5c0.jpg","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/kc450zvGig-qAbMR3-i2Ifyy-NnuMJr-36baIv.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/55513717_4c4a1f7fe455440b8d5a14bd81f1c5c0.jpg"]},"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/179922_d1f3e455380346a0bdd3ebec5b12996f.png","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/kc450zvGig-qAbMR3-i2Ifyy-NnuMJr-36baIv.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/179922_d1f3e455380346a0bdd3ebec5b12996f.png"]},"5644cb55cccd38